{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50924","headline":"过金鷄石 · 吕从庆","name":"过金鷄石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金鷄自天来，桑麻列青眼。\n羣耳无一聪，昂冠复飞返。\n遗音此寂然，千秋意何限。\n所幸一片石，犹在田中坂。\n我来抚弄之，襟怀日以散。\n寄语埘中禽，尔徒博飱饭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}